{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Neon Dash</i></strong> is a Retro-Futurism style rhythm platformer game. Get past challenging obstacles to the music's beat, and journey back to the dreamy 80s to push your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, fly, switch gravity, and teleport to the beat of the music to avoid various obstacles on the platforms. By collecting BEATs, you can unlock different idle backgrounds and attempt to gather all STARs to achieve the perfect completion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive into the neon summer nights of the 80s, with a variety of retro music: </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>City Pop, Synthwave, Lofi</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/extras/9fd70d337ea4f7162d1e472442943ef5.avif?t=1772450731\" width=960 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idle mode supports importing local music, and includes over 20 dynamic wallpapers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/extras/9e36a03ab3c03486c567dc798673a968.avif?t=1772450731\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rhythm-based platformer game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging level design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro 80s-style music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive items like flying, teleportation, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to achieve perfect completion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle-Friendly Animated Wallpaper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different idle backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music player that supports importing local music</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768570?t=1772450731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/c44186540172e6172212b0cceb0e7b6625b3b0e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772450731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/9ff71c9538a98d29c7671d764a49f892014eedd3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772450731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/9ff71c9538a98d29c7671d764a49f892014eedd3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772450731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4275380,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Neon Dash</i></strong> is a Retro-Futurism style rhythm platformer game. Get past challenging obstacles to the music's beat, and journey back to the dreamy 80s to push your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, fly, switch gravity, and teleport to the beat of the music to avoid various obstacles on the platforms. By collecting BEATs, you can unlock different idle backgrounds and attempt to gather all STARs to achieve the perfect completion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drive into the neon summer nights of the 80s, with a variety of retro music: </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>City Pop, Synthwave, Lofi</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768570/extras/9fd70d337ea4f7162d1e472442943ef5.avif?t=1772450731\" width=960 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Idle mode supports importing local music, and includes over 20 dynamic wallpapers</stro